            {
              "content": "=You are a lead qualification assistant. Extract information from this WhatsApp message and qualify the lead.\n\nWhatsApp message details:\n- From (phone): {{ $json.body['From'] }}\n- Sender name: {{ $json.body['ProfileName'] }}\n- Message: {{ $json.body['Body'] }}\n\nExtract and return ONLY a JSON object with these exact fields:\n{\n  \"name\": \"extracted full name or use ProfileName if not mentioned\",\n  \"phone\": \"extracted phone number from From field, remove whatsapp: prefix\",\n  \"company\": \"extracted company name or unknown\",\n  \"budget\": \"extracted budget or unknown\",\n  \"message\": \"brief summary of their need\",\n  \"score\": \"Hot or Warm or Cold\",\n  \"numeric_score\": <number 1-10>,\n  \"reason\": \"one sentence explanation\",\n  \"follow_up_message\": \"short personalized WhatsApp reply under 50 words\"\n}\n\nScoring: $2000+ urgent = 8-10 Hot, $500-2000 clear need = 5-7 Warm, under $500 vague = 1-4 Cold.\nReturn ONLY the JSON, no other text."
            }
          ]
        },
